OL,3,GNEWSAPeak District 'race track' warning
OL,4,Aas cars seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo cars have been seized after police
OL,7,Fin Derbyshire tracked more than 30
OL,8,Fvehicles following reports of dangerous
OL,9,Fdriving.
OL,11,FOfficers said they received multiple
OL,12,Fcalls about "high performance" cars
OL,13,Fbeing driven at excessive speed in the
OL,14,FHigh Peak area on Sunday.
OL,16,FSeveral of the vehicles were traced to
OL,17,Fthe Castleton area, Derbyshire Police
OL,18,Fsaid, while about 30 vehicles were
OL,19,Flater found on Old Mam Tor Road.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
