OL,3,GNEWSAPeak District 'race track' warning
OL,4,Aas cars seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo arrests were made but two cars were
OL,7,Fseized, prompting officers to warn
OL,8,Fdrivers that the roads of the High Peak
OL,9,F"are not a race track".
